  "display_title": "Exorcising With My Childhood Friend ♥︎",
  "description": "*\"Please let me stay close to my precious friend for a long time.\"* Childhood friends Hui-Young and Do-Hui went to an abandoned shopping mall that grants wishes to make memories before college. When they actually got there, it wasn't as gloomy as they thought, and it didn't seem like it would grant their wishes...? But the problem was that night. Do-Hui woke up feeling like someone was constantly touching him. At first, he just fumbled, but it gradually escalated. When he couldn't handle it alone, he finally told Hui-Young.\n\nHui-Young, ghosts keep touching me, please save me!\n\n*Note: Includes two extra chapters.*",
